Generated by combinr
---------------------
  smalltest.consensus.gff3.golden

A frozen snapshot of combinr's own `consensus` output on the inputs above
(note the `combinr` value in the GFF3 source column). It is a self-golden:
regenerate it from the binary when a change to the consensus output is
intentional. No EVidenceModeler code runs at test time.
